tuse_fastinterp\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tUse Fast Interpreter\tWhen the CPU JIT is disabled, use the fast interpreter instead of the legacy interpreter. Restart required.\tCore\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tCore\tcpu_clock_percentage\tINT\t100\t5\t400\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tCPU Clock Speed\t\u0001\tCore\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tis_new_3ds\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tNew 3DS Mode\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tlle_applets\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tUse LLE Applets (if installed)\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tenable_required_online_lle_modules\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable required LLE modules for online features (if installed)\tEnables the LLE modules required for online multiplayer, eShop access, etc.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tData%20Storage\tuse_virtual_sd\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tData Storage\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tData%20Storage\tuse_custom_storage\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tData Storage\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tData%20Storage\tcompress_cia_installs\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tCompress installed CIA content\tCompresses the content of CIA files when installed to the emulated SD card. Only affects CIA content which is installed while the setting is enabled.\tData Storage\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tData%20Storage\tasync_fs_operations\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tAsynchronous filesystem operations\tMakes emulated filesystem accesses asynchronous. Greatly reduces filesystem related stutter, but may slightly increase load times.\tData Storage\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tregion_value\tINT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tinit_clock\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EDevice Clock\u001F1\u001ESimulated Clock\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tClock\tSet the emulated 3DS clock to either reflect that of your device or start at a simulated date and time.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tinit_time\tINT\t946681277\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tinit_time_offset\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tinit_ticks_type\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERandom\u001F1\u001EFixed\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tinit_ticks_override\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tplugin_loader\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t3GX Plugin Loader\tLoads 3GX plugins from the emulated SD card if they are available.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tallow_plugin_loader\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tAllow Applications to Change Plugin Loader State\tAllows homebrew apps to enable the plugin loader even when it is disabled.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tsteps_per_hour\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tPedometer Steps per Hour\tNumber of steps per hour reported by the pedometer. Range from 0 to 65,535.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tSystem\tapply_region_free_patch\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tApply region free patch to installed applications\tPatches the region of installed applications to be region free, so that they always appear on the home menu.\tSystem\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tgraphics_api\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ESoftware\u001F1\u001EOpenGLES\u001F2\u001EVulkan\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tGraphics API\t\u0001\tRenderer\n",
    "azaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tphysical_device\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\trenderer_debug\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDebug Renderer\tLog additional graphics related debug information. When enabled, game performance will be significantly reduced.\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tpica_debugging\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tdump_command_buffers\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tspirv_shader_gen\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable SPIR-V shader generation\tEmits the fragment shader used to emulate PICA using SPIR-V instead of GLSL\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tdisable_spirv_optimizer\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDisable SPIR-V Optimizer\tDisables the SPIR-V optimization pass, reducing stuttering considerably while barely affecting performance.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tasync_shader_compilation\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable Asynchronous Shader Compilation\tCompiles shaders in the background to reduce stuttering during gameplay. When enabled expect temporary graphical glitches\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tasync_presentation\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_hw_shader\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable Hardware Shader\tUses hardware to emulate 3DS shaders. When enabled, game performance will be significantly improved.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_disk_shader_cache\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDisk Shader Cache\tReduce stuttering by storing and loading generated shaders to disk. It cannot be used without Enabling Hardware Shader.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_skip_duplicate_frames\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tSkip Presenting Duplicate Frames\tSkips the presentation of frames that are not unique. It also allows external frame generation tools to work correctly with 30fps games\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tshaders_accurate_mul\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tAccurate Multiplication\tUses more accurate multiplication in hardware shaders, which may fix some graphical bugs. When enabled, performance will be reduced.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_vsync\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable V-Sync\tSynchronizes the game frame rate to the refresh rate of your device. Can cause additional input latency but may reduce tearing in some cases.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_display_refresh_rate_detection\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_shader_jit\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable Shader JIT\tUse the JIT engine instead of the interpreter for software shader emulation.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tresolution_factor\tINT\t1\t0\t18\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tInternal Resolution\tSpecifies the resolution used to render at. A high resolution will improve visual quality a lot but is also quite heavy on performance and might cause glitches in certain applications.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tuse_integer_scaling\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tInteger Scaling\tScales the screens with an integer multiplier of the original 3DS screen. For layouts with two different screen sizes, the largest screen is integer-scaled.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tframe_limit\tFLOAT\t100\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tLimit Speed Percent\tSpecifies the percentage to limit emulation speed. With the default of 100% emulation will be limited to normal speed. Values higher or lower will increase or decrease the speed limit.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tturbo_limit\tFLOAT\t200\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tTurbo Speed Limit\tEmulation speed limit used while the turbo hotkey is active.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\ttexture_filter\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ENone\u001F1\u001EAnime4K\u001F2\u001EBicubic\u001F3\u001EScaleForce\u001F4\u001ExBRZ\u001F5\u001EMMPX\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tTexture Filter\tEnhances the visuals of applications by applying a filter to textures. The supported filters are Anime4K Ultrafast, Bicubic, ScaleForce, xBRZ freescale, and MMPX.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\ttexture_sampling\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EGame Controlled\u001F1\u001ENearest Neighbor\u001F2\u001ELinear\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tTexture Sampling\tOverrides the sampling filter used by games. This can be useful in certain cases with poorly behaved games when upscaling. If unsure, set this to Game Controlled.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tdelay_game_render_thread_us\tINT\t0\t0\t65000\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDelay Game Render Thread\tDelay the game render thread when it submits data to the GPU. Helps with performance issues in the (very few) applications with dynamic framerates.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tsimulate_3ds_gpu_timings\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tSimulate 3DS GPU Timings\tDelays GPU completion events based on measurements taken from real hardware, so that games have more realistic GPU time measurements. Helps stabilize dynamic FPS games. Disabling this feature may improve performance in some rare cases at the cost of stability.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tlayout_option\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOriginal\u001F1\u001ESingle Screen\u001F2\u001ELarge Screen\u001F3\u001ESide by Side Screens\u001F4\u001EHybrid Screens\u001F5\u001ECustom Layout\u001F6\u001ECustomLayout\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tLandscape Screen Layout\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tswap_screen\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tupright_screen\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tRotate Screen Upright\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tlarge_screen_proportion\tFLOAT\t4.\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tLarge Screen Proportion\tHow many times larger is the large screen than the small screen in Large Screen layout?\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_gap\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tScreen Gap\tGap between screens in all two-screen modes. Measured in px relative to the 240px height of the larger screen.\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tsmall_screen_position\tENUM\t2\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ETop Right\u001F1\u001EMiddle Right\u001F2\u001EBottom Right (Default)\u001F3\u001ETop Left\u001F4\u001EMiddle Left\u001F5\u001EBottom Left\u001F6\u001EAbove\u001F7\u001EBelow\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tSmall Screen Position\tWhere should the small screen appear relative to the large one in Large Screen Layout?\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_top_x\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tX-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_top_y\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tY-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_top_width\tINT\t800\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tWidth\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_top_height\tINT\t480\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tHeight\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_bottom_x\tINT\t80\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tX-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_bottom_y\tINT\t500\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tY-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_bottom_width\tINT\t640\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tWidth\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_bottom_height\tINT\t480\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tHeight\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_second_layer_opacity\tINT\t100\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tCustom Layout Second Screen Opacity\tThe opacity of the second 3DS screen when using a custom screen layout. Useful if the second screen is to be positioned on top of the first screen.\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_top_stretch\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_top_leftright_padding\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_top_topbottom_padding\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_bottom_stretch\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_bottom_leftright_padding\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tscreen_bottom_topbottom_padding\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tportrait_layout_option\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EDefault\u001F1\u001ECustom Layout\u001F2\u001EOriginal\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tPortrait Screen Layout\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_top_x\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tX-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_top_y\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tY-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_top_width\tINT\t800\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tWidth\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_top_height\tINT\t480\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tHeight\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_bottom_x\tINT\t80\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tX-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_bottom_y\tINT\t500\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tY-Position\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_bottom_width\tINT\t640\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tWidth\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tcustom_portrait_bottom_height\tINT\t480\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tHeight\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tbg_red\tFLOAT\t0.\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tbg_green\tFLOAT\t0.\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tbg_blue\tFLOAT\t0.\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\trender_3d\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOff\u001F1\u001ESide by Side\u001F2\u001ESide by Side Full Width\u001F3\u001EAnaglyph\u001F4\u001EInterlaced\u001F5\u001EReverse Interlaced\u001F6\u001ECardboard VR\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tStereoscopic 3D Mode\tChoose the stereoscopic 3D mode for 3D rendering. Side by Side modes are most common in modern use. Anaglyph and Interlaced modes will always apply to all connected displays.\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tfactor_3d\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDepth\tSpecifies the value of the 3D slider. This should be set to higher than 0% when Stereoscopic 3D is enabled. Note: Depth values over 100% are not possible on real hardware and may cause graphical issues\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tswap_eyes_3d\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tSwap Eyes\tSwaps which eye is shown in which side. Combined with Side by Side mode makes it possible to see 3D by crossing your eyes!\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\trender_3d_which_display\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOff\u001F1\u001EOn (All Displays)\u001F2\u001EOn (Primary Display Only)\u001F3\u001EOn (Secondary Display Only)\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tRender Stereoscopic 3D\tWhether to enable stereoscopic 3D, and on which displays. The single display options are only relevant when multiple displays are connected.\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tmono_render_option\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ELeftEye\u001F1\u001ERightEye\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tfilter_mode\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tLinear Filtering\tEnables linear filtering, which causes game visuals to appear smoother.\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tpp_shader_name\tSTRING\tNone (builtin)\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tLayout\tanaglyph_shader_name\tSTRING\tDubois (builtin)\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tLayout\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tUtility\tdump_textures\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDump Textures\tTextures are dumped to dump/textures/[Title ID]/.\tUtility\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tUtility\tcustom_textures\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tCustom Textures\tTextures are loaded from load/textures/[Title ID]/.\tUtility\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tUtility\tpreload_textures\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tUtility\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tUtility\tasync_custom_loading\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tAsync Custom Texture Loading\tLoad custom textures asynchronously with background threads to reduce loading stutter.\tUtility\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tRenderer\tdisable_right_eye_render\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDisable Right Eye Render\tGreatly improves performance in some applications, but can cause flickering in others.\tRenderer\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\taudio_emulation\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EHLE\u001F1\u001ELLE\u001F2\u001ELLEMultithreaded\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\tenable_audio_stretching\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tAudio Stretching\tStretches audio to reduce stuttering. When enabled, increases audio latency and slightly reduces performance.\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\tenable_realtime_audio\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable Realtime Audio\tScales audio playback speed to account for drops in emulation framerate. This means that audio will play at full speed even while the game framerate is low. May cause audio desync issues.\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\tvolume\tFLOAT\t1.\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\toutput_device\tSTRING\tAuto\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\tinput_device\tSTRING\tAuto\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tAudio\tsimulate_headphones_plugged\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tSimulate Headphones Plugged In\tSimulates whether headphones are plugged in to the emulated 3DS system.\tAudio\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tCore\tdelay_start_for_lle_modules\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tDelay Start With LLE Modules\tDelays the start of the app when LLE modules are enabled.\tCore\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tuse_gdbstub\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tgdbstub_port\tINT\t24689\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tinstant_debug_log\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tFlush Log Output on Every Message\tImmediately commits the debug log to file. Use this if Azahar crashes and the log output is being cut.\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tenable_rpc_server\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tEnable RPC Server\tEnables the RPC server on port 45987. This allows remotely reading/writing guest memory.\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\ttoggle_unique_data_console_type\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tToggle unique data console type\tToggles the unique data console type (Old 3DS &#8596; New 3DS) to be able to download the opposite system firmware type from system settings.\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tDebugging\tenable_exception_handler\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebugging\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tWebService\tweb_api_url\tSTRING\thttp://88.198.47.46:5000\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\tWeb API URL\tWeb API URL for public room functionality\tWebService\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tMiscellaneous\tlog_filter\tSTRING\t*:Info\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tMiscellaneous\nazaharplus\t\u0001\tMiscellaneous\tlog_regex_filter\tSTRING\t\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcf90688448\t\u0001\t\u0001\tMiscellaneous\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tinitial-setup\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tEmulator\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tgdbstub\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tEmulator\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tlog-active-shaders\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\tdebug\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebug\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tlog-uniforms\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\tdebug\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebug\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tlog-compat-warn\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tEmulator\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tvalidation-layer\tBOOL\ttrue\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\tdebug\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tDebug\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tpstv-mode\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\tsystem\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tSystem\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tshow-mode\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tEmulator\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tdemo-mode\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuous\t\u0001\t\u0001\tEmulator\nvita3k\t\u0001\t\tapps-list-grid\tBOOL\tfalse\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tcontinuo