ginal 4:3 aspect ratio. Expand will adjust to match the game window's aspect ratio.\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgraphics.json\t\twm_option\tENUM\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\tWindowed\u001FFullscreen\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tWindow Mode\tSets whether the game should display Windowed or Fullscreen. You can also use F11 or Alt + Enter to toggle this option.\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgraphics.json\t\trr_option\tENUM\tDisplay\t\u0001\t\u0001\tOriginal\u001FDisplay\u001FManual\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tFramerate\t\u0001\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgraphics.json\t\trr_manual_value\tINT\t60\t20\t240\t\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\t\u0001\t\u0001\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgraphics.json\t\tmsaa_option\tENUM\tMSAA2X\t\u0001\t\u0001\tNone\u001FMSAA2X\u001E2X\u001FMSAA4X\u001E4X\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tMS Anti-Aliasing\tSets the multisample anti-aliasing (MSAA) quality level. This reduces jagged edges in the final image at the expense of rendering performance. Note: This option won't be available if your GPU does not support programmable MSAA sample positions, as it is currently required to avoid rendering glitches.\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgraphics.json\t\thr_option\tENUM\tClamp16x9\t\u0001\t\u0001\tOriginal\u001FClamp16x9\u001E16:9\u001FExpand\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tHUD Placement\tAdjusts the placement of HUD elements to fit the selected aspect ratio. Expand will use the aspect ratio of the game's output window.\tGraphics\ndinotale\tgeneral.json\t\trumble_strength\tINT\t25\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tRumble Strength\tControls the strength of rumble when using a controller that supports it. Setting this to zero will disable rumble.\tGeneral\ndinotale\tgeneral.json\t\tjoystick_deadzone\tINT\t5\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tJoystick Deadzone\tApplies a deadzone to joystick inputs.\tGeneral\ndinotale\tgeneral.json\t\tbackground_input_mode\tENUM\tOn\t\u0001\t\u0001\tOff\u001FOn\t0\t\u0001\t0.1.6\tBackground Input Mode\tAllows the game to read controller input when out of focus. This setting does not affect keyboard input.\tGeneral\nzelda64recomp