le. Does not affect using other widgets.\tSettings / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FMods\tAlternateAssetsHotkey\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tAlt Assets Tab hotkey\tAllows pressing the Tab key to toggle alternate assets\tSettings / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgGameMasterVolume\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tMaster Volume\tAdjust the overall sound volume.\tSettings / Audio\n",
    "spaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgMainMusicVolume\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tMain Music Volume\tAdjust the background music volume.\tSettings / Audio\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgSFXMusicVolume\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tSound Effects Volume\tAdjust the sound effects volume.\tSettings / Audio\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnvironmentVolume\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tEnvironment Volume\tAdjust the environment volume.\tSettings / Audio\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgInterpolationFPS\tINT\t30\t30\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tCurrent FPS\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgMatchRefreshRate\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tMatch Refresh Rate\tMatches interpolation value to the current game's window refresh rate.\tSettings / Graphics\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgExtraLatencyThreshold\tINT\t80\t0\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tJitter fix : >=FPS\tWhen Interpolation FPS setting is at least this threshold, add one frame of input lag (e.g. 16.6 ms for 60 FPS) in order to avoid jitter. This setting allows the CPU to work on one frame while GPU works on the previous frame.\\nThis setting should be used when your computer is too slow to do CPU + GPU work in time.\tSettings / Graphics\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgMultiplayerNoFeatureCuts\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tNo multiplayer feature cuts\tAllows full train and jumbotron in multiplayer, etc.\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgBetterResultPortraits\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tWidescreen portrait spacing\tAlters result portrait spacing for better aesthetics on widescreen\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgDisableLod\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tNo Level of Detail (LOD)\tDisable Level of Detail (LOD) to avoid models using lower poly versions at a distance\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNoCulling\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tDisable Culling\tDisable original culling of mk64\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgDisableRubberbanding\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tDisable Rubberbanding\tDisable rubberbanding in the game.\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgFarFrustrum\tFLOAT\t10000.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tFar Frustrum\tSay how Far the Frustrum are when 'Disable Culling' are enable\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnableCustomCC\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tEnable Custom CC\t\u0001\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgCustomCC\tFLOAT\t150.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tCustom CC\t\u0001\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnableDigitalSpeedometer\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tEnable Digital Speedometer\tWelcome to the modern era\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgHarderCPU\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tHarder CPU\t\u0001\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgShowSpaghettiVersion\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tShow Spaghetti version\tShow the Spaghetti Kart version on the Mario Kart menu\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgLookBehind\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tEnable Look Behind Camera\tPress C-Left to look behind you\tEnhancements / General\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnableMoonJump\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tMoon Jump\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Cheats\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNoWallColision\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tDisable Wall Collision\tDisable wall collision.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgMinHeight\tFLOAT\t0.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tMin Height\tWhen Disable Wall Collision are enable what is the minimal height you can get.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgUniqueCharacterSelections\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tUnique Character Selections\tPrevents players from selecting the same character\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgDisableItemboxes\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tNo Itemboxes\tPrevents Itemboxes from spawning\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgAllThwompsAreMarty\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tAll Thwomps are Marty\tAll Thwomps are Marty\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgAllBombKartsChase\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tAll Bomb Karts in Chase Mode\tThese karts will chase you!!!\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgGoFish\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tGet the trophies!\tCollect as many trophies as you can. Racer with the most trophies wins!\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumTrains\tINT\t2\t0\t19\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tTrains\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumCarriages\tINT\t5\t0\t74\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tCarriages\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgHasTender\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tTrain has a tender\tThis option is only valid if there are no carriages on the train\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumTrucks\tINT\t7\t0\t50\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tTrucks\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumBuses\tINT\t7\t0\t50\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tBuses\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumTankerTrucks\tINT\t7\t0\t50\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tTanker Trucks\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nspaghettikart\t\u0001\tCVars\tgNumCars\tINT\t7\t0\t50\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.0\tCars\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Rulesets\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tDisableLOD\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDisable LoD\tDisable Level of Detail (LOD) to avoid models using lower poly versions at a distance\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FMods\tAlternateAssets\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tUse Alternate Assets\tToggle between standard assets and alternate assets. Usually mods will indicate if this setting has to be used or not.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tDisableDrawDistance\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDisable Draw Distance\tDisables the draw distance, rendering all objects immediately.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tAlwaysShowPowerMeter\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tShow Power Meter Always\tThe power meter will always be visible on screen.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHUDAspectRatio\tSelection\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EExpand\u001F1\u001ECustom\u001F2\u001EOriginal (4:3)\u001F3\u001EWidescreen (16:9)\u001F4\u001ENintendo 3DS (5:3)\u001F5\u001E16:10 (8:5)\u001F6\u001EUltrawide (21:9)\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tHUD Aspect Ratio\tChanges the aspect ratio of the HUD elements.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHUDAspectRatio\tX\tINT\t16\t1\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCustom HUD Aspect Ratio X\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHUDAspectRatio\tY\tINT\t9\t1\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCustom HUD Aspect Ratio Y\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tDefaultMode\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ELakitu\u001F1\u001EMario\u001F2\u001EManual\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDefault Camera Mode\tPrimary camera mode.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tAlternateMode\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ELakitu\u001F1\u001EMario\u001F2\u001EManual\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAlternate Camera Mode\tAlternate camera (R-trigger toggle)\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tHorizontalAnalog\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tHorizontal Analog Camera\tEnable horizontal analog camera\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tVerticalAnalog\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tVertical analog camera\tEnable vertical analog camera\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tImprovedCButtonCamera\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tImproved C-button Camera\tEnables smooth C-button rotation (hold = continuous)\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tCenterCameraButton\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCenter camera button\tL-trigger centers camera behind Mario\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tInvertedHorizontalCamera\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tInverted horizontal camera\tInvert horizontal camera\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tInvertedVerticalCamera\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tInverted vertical camera\tInvert vertical camera\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tCameraSpeed\tFLOAT\t32.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCamera Speed\tAnalog camera sensitivity multiplier\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tCameraDistance\tFLOAT\t100.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCamera distance\tNormal zoom distance\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tCameraDistanceZoomedOut\tFLOAT\t150.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCamera distance zoomed out\tZoomed-out distance\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tAdditionalCameraDistance\tFLOAT\t0.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAdditional camera distance\tExtra uniform distance offset\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tManualCameraSounds\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tManual camera sounds\tPlay sounds when using manual camera controls (C-buttons, L-trigger)\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tSelectAllStars\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSelect Any Star\tLet's you select any star from the menu regardless of the courses completion status.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tStarNoExit\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCollecting Stars Will Not Exit Level\tCollecting Stars will not take you out of the level.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tDisablePeachCutscene\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSkip Intro Peach Cutscene\tSkips the Peach cutscene when starting a new game.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tDisableLakituCutscene\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSkip Intro Lakitu\tThe Lakitu will not appear when Mario reaches the bridge outside Peach's \\nCastle. Also skips Bowser's message when Mario first enters the castle.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tFixKoopaRaceMusic\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tFix Koopa Race Music\tFixes the Koopa race music on Bob-omb Battlefield and Tiny-Huge Island.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FModes\u001FMirroredWorld\tMode\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMirrored World\tMirrors the world horizontally. Inverts left/right controls to match.\tEnhancements / Modes\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tInfiniteHealth\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tInfinite Health\tImpervious to Damage.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tInfiniteLives\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tInfinite Lives\tNever run of out Lives.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tPauseExitWhenever\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tPause Exit Whenever\tExit from anywhere using the Pause Menu.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tPlayInDemo\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tPlay In Demo\tAllows normal gameplay when a demo is playing.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tAlwaysFlyTripleJump\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAlways Fly on Triple Jump\tTriple jumping always starts flying, as if you always have the Wing Cap.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tFlyingTripleJumpHighLaunch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tTriple Jump High Launch\tFlying triple jump launches 3x higher than normal.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tTheme\tENUM\t5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERed\u001F1\u001EDark Red\u001F2\u001EOrange\u001F3\u001EGreen\u001F4\u001EDark Green\u001F5\u001ELight Blue\u001F6\u001EBlue\u001F7\u001EDark Blue\u001F8\u001EIndigo\u001F9\u001EViolet\u001F10\u001EPurple\u001F11\u001EBrown\u001F12\u001EGray\u001F13\u001EDark Gray\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMenu Theme\tChanges the Theme of the Menu Widgets.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tControlNav\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMenu Controller Navigation\tAllows controller navigation of the port menu (Settings, Enhancements,...)\\nCAUTION: This will disable game inputs while the menu is visible.\\n\\nD-pad to move between items, A to select, B to move up in scope.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tBackgroundOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.85\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMenu Background Opacity\tSets the opacity of the background of the port menu.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tCursorVisibility\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCursor Always Visible\tMakes the cursor always visible, even in full screen.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSidebarSearch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSearch In Sidebar\tDisplays the Search menu as a sidebar entry in Settings instead of in the header.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSearchAutofocus\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSearch Input Autofocus\tSearch input box gets autofocus when visible. Does not affect using other widgets.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tImGuiScale\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ESmall\u001F1\u001ENormal\u001F2\u001ELarge\u001F3\u001EX-Large\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tImGui Menu Scaling\tChanges the scaling of the ImGui menu elements.\tSettings / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tMaster\tINT\t50\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMaster Volume\t\u0001\tSettings / Audio\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tMainMusic\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMain Music Volume\t\u0001\tSettings / Audio\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tEnvironment\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnvironment Volume\t\u0001\tSettings / Audio\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tSFX\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSound Effects Volume\t\u0001\tSettings / Audio\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInternalResolution\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tInternal Resolution\tMultiplies your output resolution by the value inputted, as a more intensive but effective form of anti-aliasing.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMSAAValue\tINT\t1\t1\t8\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAnti-aliasing (MSAA)\tActivates MSAA (multi-sample anti-aliasing) from 2x up to 8x, to smooth the edges of rendered geometry.\\nHigher sample count will result in smoother edges on models, but may reduce performance.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInterpolationFPS\tINT\t30\t30\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tCurrent FPS\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMatchRefreshRate\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tMatch Refresh Rate\tMatches interpolation value to the refresh rate of your display.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tVsyncEnabled\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnable Vsync\tRemoves tearing, but clamps your max FPS to your displays refresh rate.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tSdlWindowedFullscreen\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tWindowed Fullscreen\tEnables Windowed Fullscreen Mode.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tEnableMultiViewports\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAllow multi-windows\tAllows multiple windows to be opened at once. Requires a reload to take effect.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tTextureUploadBudget\tINT\t1\t0\t8\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tHD Texture Upload Budget\tMax new HD-pack texture uploads per frame (0 = unlimited). Lower values spread big 4K uploads across frames so entering a new area doesn't hitch; the base texture shows until each HD replacement is ready.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tAsyncTextureLoad\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAsync Texture Loading\tDecodes HD/replacement textures on a background thread instead of blocking the render thread, so loading a level doesn't hitch. The vanilla texture shows until its HD version finishes loading, then swaps in. Only active with Alternative Assets enabled.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tTextureReplacementDebug\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDebug HD Replacement\tTints draws by HD-replacement state: blue = HD active, green flash = just uploaded, red = base shown while the HD upload is still pending.\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnable Touch Controls\tShows an on-screen virtual controller for touch screens.\\nOn desktop the mouse can drive it for testing.\tSettings / Controls\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tScale\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tTouch Controls Scale\tSize of the on-screen buttons and stick.\tSettings / Controls\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.7\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tTouch Controls Opacity\tOpacity of the on-screen controls.\tSettings / Controls\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tPosition\tENUM\t3\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ETop Left\u001F1\u001ETop Right\u001F2\u001EBottom Left\u001F3\u001EBottom Right\u001F4\u001EHidden\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tPosition\tWhich corner of the screen notifications appear in.\tSettings / Notifications\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tDuration\tFLOAT\t10.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDuration (seconds)\tHow long notifications are displayed for.\tSettings / Notifications\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tBgOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tBackground Opacity\tHow opaque the background of notifications is.\tSettings / Notifications\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tSize\tFLOAT\t1.8\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSize\tHow large notifications are.\tSettings / Notifications\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tVerticalResolutionToggle\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSet fixed vertical resolution (disables resolution slider)\tOverride the resolution scale slider and use the settings below, irrespective of window size.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tPixelPerfectMode\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tPixel Perfect Mode\tDon't scale image to fill window.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tFitAutomatically\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAutomatically scale image to fit viewport\tAutomatically sets scale factor to fit window. Only available in Pixel Perfect Mode.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tExceedBoundsBy\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tAllow integer scale factor to go +1 above maximum screen bounds.\t\u0001\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnable advanced settings.\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnable Rando\tEnables the randomizer feature.\tRando / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tGenerateLog\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tGenerate Spoiler Log\tGenerates a Spoiler Log in the randomizer folder.\tRando / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tUseExistingLog\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tLoad Existing Spoiler Log\tUses a Spoiler Log in the randomizer folder.\tRando / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tManualSeedEntry\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tManual Seed Entry\tGenerates a seed using the provided input.\tRando / General\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tSkipRandoGI\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tSkip Get Item Cutscene\tSkips the cutscene when collecting a Star.\tRando / Enhancements\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowCurrentLevel\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tOnly Show Current Level\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowLogic\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tDim Out of Logic Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nghostship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tAchievements\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t3.0.0\tEnable Achievements\tEnables the achievement system, which tracks various accomplishments and milestones in the game.\tAchievements / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\tNametags\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tShow Player Nametags\tDraw each other player's name above their character.\tRemote / Anchor\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\tNametagScale\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tNametag Distance\tMultiplies how far away another player's nametag stays visible.\tRemote / Anchor\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\tNotifications\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tShow Teammate Notifications\tShow a notification when a teammate collects a jiggy, opens a level, or (in a randomizer) obtains a shuffled check. Randomizer check notifications also require \"Send Collection Notifications\" to be enabled in the Randomizer settings.\tRemote / Anchor\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\u001FRoomSettings\tShowLocationsMode\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ENone\u001F1\u001ETeam Only\u001F2\u001EAll\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tShow Locations For\t\u0001\tRemote / Anchor / Room Settings\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\u001FRoomSettings\tTeleportMode\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ENone\u001F1\u001ETeam Only\u001F2\u001EAll\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow Teleporting To\t\u0001\tRemote / Anchor / Room Settings\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\u001FRoomSettings\tSyncItemsAndFlags\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSync Items & Flags\t\u0001\tRemote / Anchor / Room Settings\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRemote\u001FAnchor\u001FRoomSettings\tShareConsumables\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tShare Consumables (Eggs/Feathers)\t\u0001\tRemote / Anchor / Room Settings\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tSkipBootLogos\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow Start to Skip Boot Logos\tPress Start to skip the Rareware and Nintendo logos on boot.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tStartSkipIntro\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow Start to Skip Intro Cutscenes\tPress Start to Skip Intro Cutscenes.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tSkipMiscCutscenes\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow Start to Skip Misc Cutscenes\tPress Start to skip the Gruntilda's Lair and Game Over cutscenes.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tSkipJiggyDance\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSkip Jiggy Dance\tSkips the jiggy collection dance, collecting the jiggy immediately. Takes priority over the Tooie Jiggy Animation backport.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tSkipCluckerCutscene\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSkip Clucker Cutscene\tSkips the cutscene that plays when first defeating a Clucker.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCutscenes\tSkipNoteDoorDance\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSkip Note Door Dance\tSkips Banjo's dance when a note door opens, opening it immediately.\tEnhancements / Cutscenes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tDisableLOD\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDisable LOD\tForces maximum model detail everywhere.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tCutsceneAspect\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tOriginal Aspect Ratio In Cutscenes\tForces game to show original aspect ratio during cutscenes to avoid seeing unfinished edges of scene geometry.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tDrawDistance\tINT\t1\t1\t6\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tExtended Draw Distance\tMultiplies the draw distance for objects.\\nHigher values render more but cost performance.\tEnhancements / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tInvertX\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInvert Camera X\tInverts horizontal camera.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tInvertY\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInvert Camera Y\tInverts vertical camera in first-person.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look (Right Stick)\tUse the right stick to freely orbit the camera around Banjo (yaw and pitch). The camera holds its angle until you use a C-button camera control, which returns to the normal camera. While enabled, the right stick no longer acts as the C-buttons.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tYawSensitivity\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look Yaw Sensitivity\tHorizontal (left/right) free look speed.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tPitchSensitivity\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look Pitch Sensitivity\tVertical (up/down) free look speed.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tInvertX\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look Invert X\tInverts the horizontal free look direction.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tInvertY\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look Invert Y\tInverts the vertical free look direction.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\u001FFreeLook\tSmoothRate\tFLOAT\t40.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFree Look Smoothing\tHow quickly the camera settles when sliding along geometry. Lower is smoother but floatier; higher is snappier but can hitch on walls.\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCamera\tFollow\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFollow Camera\tThe camera will always follow Banjo and Kazooie when available, without requiring the player to hold R\tEnhancements / Camera\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FModes\u001FMirroredWorld\tMode\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMirrored World\tMirrors the world horizontally. Inverts left/right controls to match.\tEnhancements / Modes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tFurnaceFunDialog\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Furnace Fun Game Over Dialog\tFixes the skull panel game over warning in Furnace Fun to trigger when you have zero extra lives instead of one.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tVoidOutGameOver\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Void-Out Game Over\tPrevents a game over when voiding out with zero extra lives, since void-outs don't cost a life.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tBoggyRaceGameOver\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Boggy Race Game Over\tLosing Boggy's race with no extra lives reloads the race instead of triggering a game over.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tMumboTokenGV\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Mumbo Token: GV Water Pyramid\tLowers the mumbo token in the water pyramid to ground level after the water drains, making it reachable.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tMumboTokenMMM\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Mumbo Token: MMM Loggo\tFixes the MMM Inside Loggo token sharing a collection bitfield index with another token, causing one to despawn.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tMumboTokenCCW\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Mumbo Token: CCW Spring\tFixes the CCW Spring token sharing a collection bitfield index with another token, causing one to despawn.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tCCWFlowerReplant\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix CCW Flower Replant Softlock\tPrevents re-planting the CCW Spring flower after it's already planted.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tGnawtySpringRock\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix CCW Gnawty Rock (Spring)\tMakes Gnawty's rock indestructible in CCW Spring.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tTermiteMoundSlopes\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Termite Mound Slopes\tMakes slopes in the Mumbo's Mountain termite mound slide instantly.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tClawSwipeSlide\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Early Claw Swipe During Slide\tPrevents a claw swipe from triggering mid-slide.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tGruntyDefeatedFlag\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Grunty Defeated Flag Placement\tDelays the Grunty Defeated flag until after the Jinjonator attacks, preventing a false win if the player dies before the hit lands.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tGruntyBounce\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Bouncing Grunty\tStops Wonderwing from launching Grunty off her platform in the final battle.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tJinjoChargeSound\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Grunty Jinjo Charge Sound\tStops the Jinjo charge-up sound the instant it hits Grunty.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tChimpyStumpRumble\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMute Chimpy Replay\tMutes Chimpy and the rumbling sound his stump makes on every return trip to Mumbo's Mountain. The first rise keeps its sound.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFix\tCutsceneSync\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Cutscene Audio Sync\tCompensates for N64 frame stutters during cutscenes so audio stays in sync.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tCongaText\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Conga's Name\tCorrects a spelling error when meeting Conga as a termite.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FFixes\tFPLobbyDoorTile\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFix Freezeezy Peak Lobby\tFixes the smeared snow trim around the Freezeezy Peak entrance in Gruntilda's Lair. Requires a map reload to take effect.\tEnhancements / Fixes\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FRestorations\tReturnToLair\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tRestore Return to Lair\tRestores the unused Return to Lair option when in Worlds.\tEnhancements / Restorations\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tPermadeath\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPermadeath\tYour save file is deleted on death. Lives are ignored.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tSkipSMTutorial\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSkip Spiral Mountain Tutorial\tStart in the Lair with all basic moves and the six empty honeycombs collected.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tFurnaceFunMoves\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFurnace Fun Moves\tStart new files with the moves of an N64 Furnace Fun Moves (FFM) setup file. Egg Firing, Flight, and Wonderwing stay unlearned so Bottles still teaches them with their free eggs and feathers. Has no effect on existing files.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tStopNSwop100\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tStop N' Swop at 100%\tUnlocks all Stop N' Swop items when loading a 100% save file.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tDisableSnackerSpawn\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDisable Snacker Spawn\tPrevents Snacker the shark from spawning in Treasure Trove Cove and Rusty Bucket Bay.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tWaterPyramidTimer\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tExtra Time For GV Water Pyramid\tAdds 4 extra seconds to the GV water pyramid hatch timer.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tEasierBoggyRaces\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tEasier Boggy Races\tReduces Boggy's max speed during both sled races in Freezeezy Peak.\\nRequires a map reload to take effect.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tEasierMrVile\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tEasier Mr Vile\tReduces Mr Vile's max speed during all three phases of his mini game in Bubblegloop Swamp.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FBackports\tJiggyAnimation\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tTooie Jiggy Animation\tReplaces the jiggy collection dance with a Banjo-Tooie style animation. Has no effect while Skip Jiggy Dance (under Cutscenes) is on.\tEnhancements / Tooie Backports\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FBackports\tHoneyback\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHoneyback Health Regen\tBackports Banjo-Tooie's Honeyback: once all 24 empty honeycombs are collected, your health slowly refills one honeycomb at a time after a short pause when you stop taking damage.\tEnhancements / Tooie Backports\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FBackports\tFastSwim\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFast Swimming\tHold A+B while underwater to combine Banjo's kick with Kazooie's wing stroke for faster swimming.\tEnhancements / Tooie Backports\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FBackports\tEggAim\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFirst-Person Egg Aim\tBackports Banjo-Tooie's Egg Aim to fire eggs while in first-person camera view.\tEnhancements / Tooie Backports\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FSaving\tPersistBottlesBonus\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPersist Bottles Bonus\tPersists Bottle Bonus progress through the save file.\tEnhancements / Saving\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FSaving\tPersistExtraLives\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPersist Extra Lives\tPersists Extra Lives through the save file.\tEnhancements / Saving\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tNoteRetention\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tNote Collection Retention\tNotes you've already collected stay collected and don't respawn when you revisit a level. Collection is always tracked; this toggle controls whether collected notes are skipped on load. Note-door totals still use the vanilla per-level high score.\tEnhancements / Saving\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGameplay\tJinjoRetention\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tJinjo Collection Retention\tJinjos you've already collected stay collected across visits instead of resetting each time you enter a level, so you no longer need all five in one go. Collection is always tracked; this toggle controls whether collected jinjos are skipped on load and your progress is restored.\tEnhancements / Saving\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteHealth\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Health\tPrevents health from decreasing.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteAir\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Air\tPrevents air from decreasing while underwater.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteLives\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Lives\tKeeps lives at 9 (max displayable).\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteEggs\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Eggs\tRefills eggs to your current max capacity when below max.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteRedFeathers\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Red Feathers\tRefills red feathers to your current max capacity when below max.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteGoldFeathers\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Gold Feathers\tRefills gold feathers to your current max capacity when below max.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tInfiniteBootsSneakers\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInfinite Boots & Sneakers\tWading Boots and Turbo Talon Sneakers timers never expire.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tLevitate\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHold L to Levitate\tHold L to levitate upward with gravity disabled.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tTalonTrotCycle\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tD-pad Talon Trot Cycling\tWhile in Talon Trot: D-pad Right cycles forward (Normal->Boots->Sneakers), D-pad Left cycles backward.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tFastTransform\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tFast Transformation\tSpeeds up Mumbo transformation animation by 3x.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tCycleTransform\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tD-pad Cycle Transform\tPress D-pad Up/Down to cycle through transformation forms.\\nUp: Forward (Banjo->Termite->...->Bee->Banjo), Down: Backward.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FCheats\tNoMumboUntransform\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tNo Mumbo Untransform\tDisables Mumbo untransforming you when going too far and skips his warning dialog.\tEnhancements / Cheats\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgDisplayOverlay\tBackground\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHide Window Background\tHides the background of the Display Overlay window.\tEnhancements / Trackers\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgDisplayOverlay\tScale\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tTimer Scale\tAdjust the Scale for the Display Overlay window.\tEnhancements / Trackers\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tVerticalResolutionToggle\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSet fixed vertical resolution (disables resolution slider)\tOverride the resolution scale slider and use the settings below, irrespective of window size.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tPixelPerfectMode\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPixel Perfect Mode\tDon't scale image to fill window.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tFitAutomatically\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAutomatically scale image to fit viewport\tAutomatically sets scale factor to fit window. Only available in Pixel Perfect Mode.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tExceedBoundsBy\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow integer scale factor to go +1 above maximum screen bounds.\t\u0001\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tEnable advanced settings.\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tTheme\tENUM\t5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERed\u001F1\u001EDark Red\u001F2\u001EOrange\u001F3\u001EGreen\u001F4\u001EDark Green\u001F5\u001ELight Blue\u001F7\u001EBlue\u001F8\u001EDark Blue\u001F9\u001EIndigo\u001F10\u001EViolet\u001F11\u001EPurple\u001F12\u001EBrown\u001F13\u001EGray\u001F14\u001EDark Gray\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMenu Theme\tChanges the Theme of the Menu Widgets.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tControlNav\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMenu Controller Navigation\tAllows controller navigation of the port menu (Settings, Enhancements,...)\\nCAUTION: This will disable game inputs while the menu is visible.\\n\\nD-pad to move between items, A to select, B to move up in scope.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tBackgroundOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.85\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMenu Background Opacity\tSets the opacity of the background of the port menu.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tCursorVisibility\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tCursor Always Visible\tMakes the cursor always visible, even in full screen.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSidebarSearch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSearch In Sidebar\tDisplays the Search menu as a sidebar entry in Settings instead of in the header.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSearchAutofocus\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSearch Input Autofocus\tSearch input box gets autofocus when visible. Does not affect using other widgets.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tBootSequence\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EDefault\u001F1\u001EAuthentic\u001F2\u001EFile Select\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tBoot Sequence\tConfigure what happens when starting or resetting the game.\\n\\nDefault: Replace the N64 branding with LUS branding\\nAuthentic: Keep the authentic N64 branding\\nFile Select: Skip to file select menu\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tA11yDisableScreenShake\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDisable Screen Shake\tStops the camera shaking on impacts such as Beak Buster landings, boulders and boss attacks. Controller rumble is unaffected.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tImGuiScale\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ESmall\u001F1\u001ENormal\u001F2\u001ELarge\u001F3\u001EX-Large\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tImGui Menu Scaling\tChanges the scaling of the ImGui menu elements.\tSettings / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tMaster\tINT\t40\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMaster Volume\t\u0001\tSettings / Audio\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInternalResolution\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tInternal Resolution\tMultiplies your output resolution by the value inputted, as a more intensive but effective form of anti-aliasing.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMSAAValue\tINT\t1\t1\t8\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAnti-aliasing (MSAA)\tActivates MSAA (multi-sample anti-aliasing) from 2x up to 8x, to smooth the edges of rendered geometry.\\nHigher sample count will result in smoother edges on models, but may reduce performance.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInterpolationFPS\tINT\t30\t30\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tCurrent FPS\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMatchRefreshRate\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tMatch Refresh Rate\tMatches interpolation value to the refresh rate of your display.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tVsyncEnabled\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tEnable Vsync\tRemoves tearing, but clamps your max FPS to your displays refresh rate.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tSdlWindowedFullscreen\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tWindowed Fullscreen\tEnables Windowed Fullscreen Mode.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tEnableMultiViewports\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tAllow multi-windows\tAllows multiple windows to be opened at once. Requires a reload to take effect.\tSettings / Graphics\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FControls\tScheme\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERetro\u001F1\u001EModern\u001F2\u001EPocket\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tControl Scheme\tApplies a preset gamepad layout (asks to confirm first).\\nRetro: Traditional N64 controls.\\nModern: Xbox Live Arcade controls.\\nPocket: D-Pad friendly controls.\\n\\nApplying a scheme overwrites the gamepad bindings; you can still customize them afterwards in the bindings window.\tSettings / Controls\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FControls\tTalonTrotToggle\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tToggle Talon Trot\tTalon Trot stays active without holding crouch. Enter the trot as usual, then release crouch and it sticks; tap crouch again to stop.\\nWhen off, Talon Trot lasts only while you hold crouch.\tSettings / Controls\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FControls\tPocketTipToeHold\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPocket: Hold to Tip-toe\tPocket scheme only. The R2 button slows movement to a tip-toe walk.\\nOff: tap R2 to toggle tip-toe on/off.\\nOn: tip-toe only while R2 is held.\tSettings / Controls\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tPosition\tENUM\t3\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ETop Left\u001F1\u001ETop Right\u001F2\u001EBottom Left\u001F3\u001EBottom Right\u001F4\u001EHidden\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tPosition\tWhich corner of the screen notifications appear in.\tSettings / Notifications\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tDuration\tFLOAT\t10.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDuration (seconds)\tHow long notifications are displayed for.\tSettings / Notifications\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tBgOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tBackground Opacity\tHow opaque the background of notifications is.\tSettings / Notifications\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tSize\tFLOAT\t1.8\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSize\tHow large notifications are.\tSettings / Notifications\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowCurrentLevel\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tOnly Show Current Level\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowLogic\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDim Out of Logic Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tHideCompletedWorld\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHide Completed Worlds\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tHideCollected\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHide Collected Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tHideSkipped\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHide Skipped Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowCollectedChecks\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDisplay Total Collected Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\n",
    "lighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tShowWorldChecks\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tDisplay Total World Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tSeparateCollectedChecks\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSeparate Total Collected Checks\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRando\u001FCheckTracker\tFloating\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tToggle Floating Window\t\u0001\tRando / Check Tracker\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tEnable\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tEnable Rando\tEnables Randomizer on the next new save file.\tRando / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tUseExistingLog\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tLoad Existing Spoiler Log\tUses a Spoiler Log in the randomizer folder.\tRando / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tRandoNotifications\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tSend Collection Notifications\tSends notifications when you collect a Rando Item.\tRando / General\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\tManualInput\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tUse Manual Seed Input\t\u0001\tRando Settings\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\u001FJunk\tHealthRefill\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tHoneycomb Refills\tAdds Health Refills to the Junk List.\tRando / Junk Options\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\u001FJunk\tBlueEggs\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tBlue Eggs\tAdds Blue Eggs to the Junk List.\tRando / Junk Options\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\u001FJunk\tRedFeathers\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tRed Feathers\tAdds Red Feathers to the Junk List.\tRando / Junk Options\nlighthouse\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgRandoSettings\u001FJunk\tGoldFeathers\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.1.0\tGold Feathers\tAdds Gold Feathers to the Junk List.\tRando / Junk Options\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tInfiniteHealth\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tInfinite Health\tMario's HP won't decrease during battle.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tInfiniteFlowerPoints\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tInfinite Flower Points\tMario's FP won't decrease during battle.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tNoBPCost\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tNo Badge Cost\tEquip any badge regardless of BP cost.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tMaxStarPower\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMax Star Power\tStar Power stays full and won't decrease.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tMaxPowerBounceChance\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMax Power Bounce Chance\tPower Bounce's and Goombario's Multibonk's chance to continue stays full, so a chain only ends when you miss the timing or reach the bounce limit.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tDoubleRewards\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\t2x Star Points and Coins\tDefeated enemies give twice the Star Points and coins.\tEnhancements / Cheats\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tPreventLoadingZoneStorage\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tDX: Prevent Loading Zone Storage\tLocks out player input the moment a loading zone is triggered, which patches out the Loading Zone Storage glitch. Off by default to match the original game. Note that most loading zones also trigger while you are airborne above them, so enabling this can freeze Mario in midair until he lands.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tSprintButton\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSprint Button\tHold R to move at double speed in the overworld.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tFreeQoLBadges\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tFree QoL Badges\tSpeedy Spin, I Spy and Peekaboo cost 0 BP.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tActionCommandDifficulty\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOriginal\u001F1\u001EForgiving (-1 level)\u001F2\u001EVery Forgiving (-2 levels)\u001F3\u001EExtremely Forgiving (-3 levels)\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAction Command Difficulty\tLowers the difficulty of attack action commands, which widens their input windows. Stacks with the Dodge Master badge.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\tBlockWindowMode\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOriginal (3 frames)\u001F1\u001EForgiving (7 frames)\u001F2\u001EVery Forgiving (10 frames)\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tBlock Window\tSets the window for timed defensive blocks. The default is 3 frames. Anything wider overrides the Dodge Master badge.\tEnhancements / Gameplay\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tFullHeightView\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tFull Height View\tRemoves the letterboxing bars on the top and bottom of the screen in gameplay.\tEnhancements / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tRoundedReel\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tRounded Projector Reel\tFlips the battle projector reel to appear rounded for widescreen resolutions.\tEnhancements / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FGraphics\tDisableMipmaps\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tDisable Mipmaps\tJust like emulator!\tEnhancements / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tAlwaysShow\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAlways Show Status Bar\tKeeps the status bar on screen in the overworld instead of hiding it a few seconds after your stats change. It still hides during cutscenes and conversations.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tScale\tINT\t100\t50\t200\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tStatus Bar Scale\tScales the whole status bar. HP, FP and Star Power grow from the left edge; the counters on the right grow from the right edge.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowBackground\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Background\tDraws the box behind the status bar.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tFlatBottom\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tFlat Bottom\tMakes the box one height all the way across, instead of stepping up after the Star Power gauge.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tFlatColor\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tFlat Color\tFills the box with one solid color, without its highlight, shadow and outline.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tBoxWidth\tINT\t100\t20\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tBox Width\tHow far the box reaches across the screen. The icons and numbers stay where they are.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tBoxHeight\tINT\t100\t50\t200\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tBox Height\tHow tall the box is. The icons and numbers stay where they are.\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowHP\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow HP\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowFP\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow FP\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowStarPower\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Star Power\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowStarPoints\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Star Points\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowCoins\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Coins\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowStarPieces\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Star Pieces\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgEnhancements\u001FStatusBar\tShowBadges\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Badges\t\u0001\tEnhancements / Status Bar\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tVerticalResolutionToggle\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSet fixed vertical resolution (disables resolution slider)\tOverride the resolution scale slider and use the settings below, irrespective of window size.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tPixelPerfectMode\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tPixel Perfect Mode\tDon't scale image to fill window.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tFitAutomatically\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAutomatically scale image to fit viewport\tAutomatically sets scale factor to fit window. Only available in Pixel Perfect Mode.\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\u001FIntegerScale\tExceedBoundsBy\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAllow integer scale factor to go +1 above maximum screen bounds.\t\u0001\tSettings / Advanced Resolution / Integer Scale\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAdvancedResolution\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tEnable advanced settings.\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgValueViewer\tFloating\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tFloating Window\t\u0001\tValue Viewer\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgValueViewer\tShowMap\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Current Map\t\u0001\tValue Viewer\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgValueViewer\tShowPosition\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tShow Mario's Position\t\u0001\tValue Viewer\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tTheme\tENUM\t5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERed\u001F1\u001EDark Red\u001F2\u001EOrange\u001F3\u001EGreen\u001F4\u001EDark Green\u001F5\u001ELight Blue\u001F6\u001EBlue\u001F7\u001EDark Blue\u001F8\u001EIndigo\u001F9\u001EViolet\u001F10\u001EPurple\u001F11\u001EBrown\u001F12\u001EGray\u001F13\u001EDark Gray\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMenu Theme\tChanges the Theme of the Menu Widgets.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tControlNav\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMenu Controller Navigation\tAllows controller navigation of the port menu (Settings, Enhancements,...)\\nCAUTION: This will disable game inputs while the menu is visible.\\n\\nD-pad to move between items, A to select, B to move up in scope.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tBackgroundOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.85\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMenu Background Opacity\tSets the opacity of the background of the port menu.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tCursorVisibility\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tCursor Always Visible\tMakes the cursor always visible, even in full screen.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSidebarSearch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSearch In Sidebar\tDisplays the Search menu as a sidebar entry in Settings instead of in the header.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSearchAutofocus\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSearch Input Autofocus\tSearch input box gets autofocus when visible. Does not affect using other widgets.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tImGuiScale\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ESmall\u001F1\u001ENormal\u001F2\u001ELarge\u001F3\u001EX-Large\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tImGui Menu Scaling\tChanges the scaling of the ImGui menu elements.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tSaveImportToSlot\tENUM\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t1\u001ESlot 1\u001F2\u001ESlot 2\u001F3\u001ESlot 3\u001F4\u001ESlot 4\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tImport To\tWhich Paperboat save slot it imports to. Ignored when you are importing all slots.\tSettings / General\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tMaster\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMaster Volume\tScales the final audio output.\tSettings / Audio\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tMainMusic\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMain Music Volume\tVolume of background music.\tSettings / Audio\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tEnvironment\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tEnvironment Volume\tVolume of ambient environment tracks.\tSettings / Audio\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FVolume\tSFX\tINT\t100\t0\t100\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSound Effects Volume\tVolume of sound effects.\tSettings / Audio\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tEnable Touch Controls\tShows an on-screen virtual controller for touch screens.\\nOn desktop the mouse can drive it for testing.\tSettings / Controls\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tScale\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tTouch Controls Scale\tSize of the on-screen buttons and stick.\tSettings / Controls\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgTouchControls\tOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.8\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tTouch Controls Opacity\tOpacity of the on-screen controls.\tSettings / Controls\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FControls\tDPadAsLeftStick\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tD-Pad as Left Stick\tMakes the d-pad move Mario like the left stick does. The game only walks from the stick, so a handheld d-pad does nothing without it.\tSettings / Controls\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInternalResolution\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tInternal Resolution\tMultiplies your output resolution by the value inputted, as a more intensive but effective form of anti-aliasing.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMSAAValue\tINT\t1\t1\t8\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAnti-aliasing (MSAA)\tActivates MSAA (multi-sample anti-aliasing) from 2x up to 8x, to smooth the edges of rendered geometry.\\nHigher sample count will result in smoother edges on models, but may reduce performance.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tInterpolationFPS\tINT\t30\t30\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tCurrent FPS\t\u0001\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tMatchRefreshRate\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tMatch Refresh Rate\tMatches interpolation value to the refresh rate of your display.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tVsyncEnabled\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tEnable Vsync\tRemoves tearing, but clamps your max FPS to your displays refresh rate.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tSdlWindowedFullscreen\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tWindowed Fullscreen\tEnables Windowed Fullscreen Mode.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tEnableMultiViewports\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tAllow multi-windows\tAllows multiple windows to be opened at once. Requires a reload to take effect.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\t2DTextureFilter\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EDefault\u001F1\u001ESharp\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\t2D Texture Filter\tSets texture filtering for 2D sprites.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tDialogueTextFilter\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EDefault\u001F1\u001ESharp\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tDialogue Text Filter\tSets texture filtering for dialogue text.\tSettings / Graphics\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tPosition\tENUM\t3\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ETop Left\u001F1\u001ETop Right\u001F2\u001EBottom Left\u001F3\u001EBottom Right\u001F4\u001EHidden\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tPosition\tWhich corner of the screen notifications appear in.\tSettings / Notifications\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tDuration\tFLOAT\t10.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tDuration (seconds)\tHow long notifications are displayed for.\tSettings / Notifications\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tBgOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tBackground Opacity\tHow opaque the background of notifications is.\tSettings / Notifications\npaperboat\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FNotifications\tSize\tFLOAT\t1.8\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.0.3\tSize\tHow large notifications are.\tSettings / Notifications\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tTheme\tENUM\t5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001ERed\u001F1\u001EDark Red\u001F2\u001EOrange\u001F3\u001EGreen\u001F4\u001EDark Green\u001F5\u001ELight Blue\u001F6\u001EBlue\u001F7\u001EDark Blue\u001F8\u001EIndigo\u001F9\u001EViolet\u001F10\u001EPurple\u001F11\u001EBrown\u001F12\u001EGray\u001F13\u001EDark Gray\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMenu Theme\tChanges the theme of the menu widgets.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgControlNav\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMenu Controller Navigation\tAllows controller navigation of the port menu.\\nCAUTION: this disables game inputs while the menu is visible.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgAllowBackgroundInputs\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tAllow background inputs\tAllows controller input to be picked up by the game even when the window is not focused.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tBackgroundOpacity\tFLOAT\t0.85\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMenu Background Opacity\tSets the opacity of the background behind the port menu.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\tCursorVisibility\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tCursor Always Visible\tMakes the cursor always visible, even in fullscreen.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSidebarSearch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tSearch In Sidebar\tDisplays the Search page as a sidebar entry in Settings instead of in the header.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tSearchAutofocus\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tSearch Input Autofocus\tGives the search input focus when it becomes visible.\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FMenu\tEnableDRP\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tEnable Discord Rich Presence\tAdds Discord Rich Presence (DRP).\tSettings / General\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgInternalResolution\tFLOAT\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tInternal Resolution\tMultiplies the internal rendering resolution.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgLowResModePending\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOff (window resolution)\u001F1\u001EN64 (320x240, stretched 4:3)\u001F2\u001E240p (window aspect, stretched)\u001F3\u001E480p (window aspect, stretched)\u001F4\u001EN64 integer-scaled (auto-fit, pixel-perfect)\u001F5\u001EN64 integer-scaled (2x, pixel-perfect)\u001F6\u001EN64 integer-scaled (3x, pixel-perfect)\u001F7\u001EN64 integer-scaled (4x, pixel-perfect)\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tLow Resolution Mode (Needs reload)\tForces the internal framebuffer to a low resolution. Stretched modes scale the framebuffer to fill the game viewport. Pixel-perfect modes render N64-native 320x240 and draw it at an integer factor, centred with black borders, sharper retro look, no sub-pixel blur. Auto-fit picks the largest factor that still fits in the window. Overrides Internal Resolution while active. Latched at startup, changes take effect on next launch (toggling mid-session would resize the framebuffer and race the Metal renderer).\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgMSAAValue\tINT\t1\t1\t8\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tAnti-aliasing (MSAA)\tSets the MSAA level for rendered geometry.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgVsyncEnabled\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tEnable Vsync\tRemoves tearing, but can cap the game to the display refresh rate.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnhancedFps\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001EOff (60 FPS)\u001F120\u001E120 FPS\u001F180\u001E180 FPS\u001F240\u001E240 FPS\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tEnhanced Framerate (Interpolated)\tRenders extra frames between 60 Hz game ticks by interpolating object and camera motion. Game logic, physics, and input timing stay at exactly 60 Hz; only rendering is smoother. Adds up to one tick (16 ms) of visual latency. Requires a display refresh rate at or above the chosen value (or Vsync off), if the host can't keep up, the game automatically steps back down to protect game speed.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgSdlWindowedFullscreen\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tWindowed Fullscreen\tEnables borderless windowed fullscreen mode.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\tgEnableMultiViewports\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tAllow multi-windows\tAllows multiple ImGui windows to be opened at once. Requires reload to take effect.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgAdvancedResolution\u001FOverscan\tEnabled\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tCrop Overscan Border\tRemoves the black border framing the image by cropping the game's built-in title-safe margin, so the picture fills the window like it filled a CRT. Disable to see the raw N64 framebuffer including its overscan border.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgAdvancedResolution\u001FOverscan\tHorizontal\tFLOAT\t10.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tOverscan Crop, Horizontal\tHow many N64 pixels (of 320 wide) to crop from each of the left and right edges. The game's authored margin is 10.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgAdvancedResolution\u001FOverscan\tVertical\tFLOAT\t10.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tOverscan Crop, Vertical\tHow many N64 pixels (of 240 tall) to crop from each of the top and bottom edges. The game's authored margin is 10.\tSettings / Graphics\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAudio\tMasterVolume\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMaster Volume\tAdjust the overall volume of the entire game.\tSettings / Audio\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAudio\tMusicVolume\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMusic Volume\tAdjust the volume of the background music.\tSettings / Audio\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAudio\tSFXVolume\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tSound Volume\tAdjust the volume of sound effects and voices.\tSettings / Audio\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FAudio\tVoiceVolume\tFLOAT\t1.0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tVoice Volume\tAdjust the volume of character voices and the announcer.\tSettings / Audio\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgSettings\u001FFocusControl\tMuteOnFocusLoss\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tMute on Focus Loss\tSilences game audio while the window is unfocused. Restores volume on refocus.\tSettings / Audio\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockAll\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Everything\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockCaptain\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Captain Falcon\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockPurin\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Jigglypuff\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockLuigi\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Luigi\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockNess\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Ness\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockInishie\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Mushroom Kingdom\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockItemSwitch\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Item Switch Menu\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgCheats\tUnlockSoundTest\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tUnlock Sound Test Menu\t\u0001\tSettings / Cheats\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHiResTextures\tEnabled\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tEnable Hi-Res Texture Pack\tWhen on, every cache-miss texture upload hashes the decoded RGBA8 image and substitutes a matching PNG from the mods/ index at the pack's higher resolution.\tAssets / Mods\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHiResTextures\tDumpSource\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tDump Source Textures\tOn: every cache-miss with no pack hit dumps the source bytes + dimensions to <app>/hires_dump/. One file per unique texture per session.\tAssets / Mods\nbattleship\t\u0001\tCVars\u001FgHiResTextures\tDumpMissRgba\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv1.6\tDump Unmatched (native key)\tOn: each unique unmatched texture is written as a viewable .bmp plus the raw .rgba the hash was computed over. The filename is the exact <hash>#<fmt>#<siz> the pack scanner looks up.\tAssets / Mods\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_fillWindowAlphaChan\tSTRING\t-1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tMake sure alpha channel of windows default framebuffer is completely opaque at the end of each frame. Needed at least when using Wayland with older drivers. 1: do this, 0: don't do it, -1: let dhewm3 decide (default)\tSystem\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_multiSamples\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tnumber of antialiasing samples\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_mode\tINT\t5\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tvideo mode number\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_fullscreen\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\t0 = windowed, 1 = full screen\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_fullscreenDesktop\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\t0: 'real' fullscreen mode 1: keep resolution 'desktop' fullscreen mode\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_customWidth\tINT\t720\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tcustom screen width. set r_mode to -1 to activate\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_customHeight\tINT\t486\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tcustom screen height. set r_mode to -1 to activate\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_useIndexBuffers\tINT\t0\t0\t1\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tuse ARB_vertex_buffer_object for indexes\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_swapInterval\tINT\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tchanges the GL swap interval\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_gamma\tFLOAT\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tchanges gamma tables\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_brightness\tFLOAT\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tchanges gamma tables\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_gammaInShader\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tSet gamma and brightness in shaders instead using hardware gamma\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_renderer\tENUM\tbest\t\u0001\t\u0001\tbest\u001Farb2\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\thardware specific renderer path to use\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_skipNewAmbient\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tbypasses all vertex/fragment program ambient drawing\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_skipBump\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tuses a flat surface instead of the bump map\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_shadows\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tenable shadows\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_forceLoadImages\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tdraw all images to screen after registration\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_supportNoSpecular\tINT\t-1\t-1\t1\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tSupport 'nospecular' parm on lights. Vanilla Doom3 didn't, so the original maps are probably expecting it to not do anything. -1: Only support in maps that have have \"allow_nospecular\" \"1\" set in worldspawn (default), 0: never respect 'nospecular' parm 1: support 'nospecular' in all maps\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_debugLineDepthTest\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tperform depth test on debug lines\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_debugLineWidth\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\twidth of debug lines\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_debugArrowStep\tINT\t120\t0\t120\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tstep size of arrow cone line rotation in degrees\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_scaleMenusTo43\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tScale menus, fullscreen videos and PDA to 4:3 aspect ratio\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_useCarmacksReverse\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tUse Z-Fail (Carmack's Reverse) when rendering shadows\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_useStencilOpSeparate\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tUse glStencilOpSeparate() (if available) when rendering shadows\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_screenshotFormat\tINT\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tScreenshot format. 0 = TGA (default), 1 = BMP, 2 = PNG, 3 = JPG\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_screenshotJpgQuality\tINT\t75\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tScreenshot quality for JPG images (1-100). Lower value means smaller file but worse quality\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_screenshotPngCompression\tINT\t3\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\t1.5.5\t\u0001\tCompression level when using PNG screenshots (0-9). Higher levels generate smaller files, but take noticeably longer\tRenderer\ndhewm3\t\u0001\t\tr_windowResizable\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\