0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\texecute eligible render-demo playback and Raven special-effect controller frames through a sealed shared transaction; unsupported views and commands use the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_rendererSharedWorldAmbient\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\texecute every eligible classic world ambient/material surface in a complete 3D view from the backend-neutral ordered material-stage stream; any unsupported view uses the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_rendererSharedWorldInteraction\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\texecute every eligible unshadowed fixed-classic interaction light and receiver in a complete 3D view from a backend-neutral sealed stream; any unsupported view uses the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_rendererSharedWorldFogBlend\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\texecute the complete classic fog/blend light phase in an eligible 3D view from a backend-neutral sealed stream; any unsupported view uses the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_rendererSharedSubview\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\texecute eligible direct mirror and capture-backed remote-camera, mirror, reflection, refraction, and x-ray subview transactions from backend-neutral sealed records; nested child trees commit atomically at their outermost special view, while 2D/cubemap color and depth captures retain exact type, aspect, and face; unsupported subviews use the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_rendererSharedDeform\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\tenable optional, default-off backend-neutral material-deform ownership; incomplete or unsupported work retains the complete classic path\tRenderer\nopenq4\t\u0001\t\tr_useSimpleInteraction\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t0\t\u0001\tv0.13.2\t\u0001\tuse Quake 4's simpler ARB interaction shader pair a